# 0.1.7 相对 0.1.6 的净变化；一条一行，格式「分类|语言|内容」
added|zh|写入 Hosts 成功后按轮弹出一条明确的成功提示，部分失败用警告档并报出成功与失败条数，不再逐条刷屏
added|en|Apply now raises one clear success toast per round, with a warning variant reporting successful and failed counts for partial failures, instead of one notice per task
fixed|zh|修复「应用完成后自动重启正在运行的浏览器」无效果：补上 Linux 版 Edge 的真实进程名 msedge，并排除名字撞浏览器前缀的独立工具进程，避免误杀
fixed|en|Fixed auto-restart of running browsers after apply not working: recognized the real Linux Edge process name msedge and excluded unrelated tools sharing a browser name prefix from being terminated
fixed|zh|浏览器重启的每一次跳过现在如实报出原因（开关未开、本轮没写成功、30 秒内刚重启过、没温和退出、拉起失败），并补分步日志供排查
fixed|en|Every skipped browser restart now reports its real reason (disabled, nothing written, restarted within 30 seconds, did not exit gracefully, relaunch failed) and writes step-by-step logs
fixed|zh|30 秒去抖只在真正重启成功时占窗口，没扫到浏览器不再挡住后续 30 秒内的重试
fixed|en|The 30-second debounce now only holds the window after a real restart, so a run that found no browser no longer blocks retries for the next 30 seconds
updated|zh|前端引入统一同步层：命令落定只声明失效哪些事实，刷新动作由登记表转发，并补延迟兜底与焦点恢复重刷
updated|en|Introduced a frontend sync hub: commands only declare which facts are stale, refreshers are dispatched from a registry, with delayed fallback and focus-resume revalidation
